      ],
      "core": "A",
      "answer": "B",
      "dse_source": "generated://mcq/mcq-09"
    },
    {
      "id": "mcq-10",
      "section": "mcq",
      "text": "在試算表中，要統計班別為「5A」且分數≥60的學生人數，最適合使用哪個函數？\n\n\n\tA.\tCOUNTIFS\n\tB.\tSUM\n\tC.\tRANK\n\tD.\tAVERAGE\n",
      "marks": 1,
      "concepts": [
